 style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학사행정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학적부정보관리에서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">대학원명 및 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">명 확인 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">요약본 누락 주의</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">국문논문은 영문요약</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">초록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">수록분이 포함되어 있어야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">외국어논문은 국문요약</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(320</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">자이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">수록분이 포함되어 있어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">심사 년</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">/</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">작성에 주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt